# @see ADR-167
id: SLOP-001
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: AI filler phrases in code or documentation
category: quality
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .cpp .h .ts .js .py .md .txt .java .go .rb .cs .rs
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ slop.cpp
patterns:
  - regex: Certainly!
    message: "AI filler phrase — remove or rewrite in your own voice"
  - regex: I'd be happy to
    message: "AI filler phrase — remove or rewrite"
  - regex: As an AI
    message: "AI self-reference — remove"
  - regex: It's important to note
    message: "AI filler phrase — be direct"
  - regex: Let me know if
    message: "AI filler phrase in code — remove"
  - regex: I cannot and will not
    message: "AI refusal pattern in code — remove"
  - regex: I hope this helps
    message: "AI sign-off phrase — remove"
  - regex: Feel free to
    message: "AI filler — be direct about what the user should do"
  - regex: Happy coding!
    message: "AI sign-off in code — remove"
  - regex: Absolutely!.*(?:here|let)
    message: "AI enthusiasm filler — be direct"
fix: Remove AI-generated filler and rewrite in your own voice.
